  "body": "Build Your Dream Home in Ara Hills\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure an individual, standalone section of this quality in Ara Hills are becoming increasingly rare. While surrounding land in the area is largely restricted and sold exclusively to major commercial building groups, 55 Kikorangi Drive offers a coveted opening for independent builders, families, and custom home designers.\r\n\r\nPositioned to capture elevated scenic views, this generous 565m² Fee Simple lot gives you the freedom to bring your own architectural vision to life in one of modern Auckland’s most desirable master-planned communities.\r\n\r\nKey Highlights\r\n\r\n• Generous Land Size: 565m² Fee Simple section (Lot 316) providing ample space for a grand design.\r\n\r\n• Scenic Sea Views: Elevated position offering pleasant local views across the landscape.\r\n\r\n• Builder's Choice: A rare standalone plot free from commercial build-group ties—bring your own preferred builder!\r\n\r\n• Prime Location: Enjoy modern community living with easy access to the Grand Drive SH1 motorway interchange, local parks, and Orewa's vibrant coastal hub.\r\n\r\n• Top School Zoning: In-zone for Orewa Primary School \r\n\r\nWhether you are looking to build your forever home or secure a prime parcel of land in a rapidly appreciating neighbourhood, 55 Kikorangi Drive is an opportunity you don't want to pass up.\r\n\r\nContact us today for full title details and property information",
